{"sectionId":"gene/regulation","items":[{"id":"gene--regulation-k001","sectionId":"gene/regulation","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"lac 오페론은 젖당 유도체 allolactose에 의해 LacI 억제가 완화되며, 포도당이 낮을 때 cAMP–CAP가 전사를 촉진한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--regulation-k002","sectionId":"gene/regulation","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"trp 오페론에서 tryptophan은 억제자의 공동억제자로 작용하며 attenuation은 leader 영역의 번역 진행에 따라 RNA hairpin 형성을 바꾼다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--regulation-k003","sectionId":"gene/regulation","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"리보스위치는 RNA가 작은 분자와 직접 결합해 구조와 발현을 변화시키는 조절 요소다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--regulation-k004","sectionId":"gene/regulation","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"진핵 염색질은 뉴클레오솜에 DNA가 감긴 구조이며 histone acetylation은 흔히 전사 접근성을 높인다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--regulation-k005","sectionId":"gene/regulation","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"CpG promoter methylation은 대체로 전사 억제와 연관되지만 위치와 맥락에 따라 다르다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--regulation-k006","sectionId":"gene/regulation","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"histone methylation은 잔기와 상태에 따라 활성 또는 억제 표지가 될 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--regulation-k007","sectionId":"gene/regulation","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"miRNA는 Drosha와 Dicer 등의 처리 후 Argonaute/RISC를 통해 표적 RNA 발현을 억제한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--regulation-k008","sectionId":"gene/regulation","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"siRNA는 높은 상보성으로 절단을 유도할 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--regulation-k009","sectionId":"gene/regulation","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"RNA 안정성, 번역 효율, 단백질 분해도 발현량을 결정한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--regulation-k010","sectionId":"gene/regulation","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"lac: 유도성, trp: 억제성 오페론.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--regulation-k011","sectionId":"gene/regulation","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"리보스위치는 RNA 자체의 구조 변화에 의존한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--regulation-k012","sectionId":"gene/regulation","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"H3K4me3는 활성 promoter, H3K27me3는 억제 염색질과 흔히 연관된다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--regulation-k013","sectionId":"gene/regulation","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"DNA 메틸화는 염기서열 자체의 돌연변이와 다르다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--regulation-k014","sectionId":"gene/regulation","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"억제자가 완화되고 CAP 활성도 높아져 강한 전사가 가능하다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]}]}